			"notes": "## 🎉 The first version of this mod!\n\n### ✅ Already supported:\n- Gemini AI Generate!\n- Fit Minecraft Components!\n- Both Customify and Vanillaify!\n\n### 🎁 Comming soon:\n- Ollama Support!(code is already written)\n- Wind, Fire, Water and Earth!\n\n### 🚗 Try It Out:\n- Create a Minecraft 1.21.10 instance with fabric loader and fabric api\n- Download `infinite-craft-1.0.0.jar` and put it to `mods/` folder\n- Create an api key [Here](https://aistudio.google.com/app/api-keys) and put it into `config/InfiniteCraft.json`(create if it's not exist):\n```json\n{\n  \"GeminiApiKey\": \"PUT_YOUR_KEY_HERE\"\n}\n```\n- Launch the game!\n\n> Bty the gemini is currectly FREE TO USE!\n\n### ⏏ Use Proxies:\n- Make sure you've enabled the system proxy\n- Open the settings for the minecraft instance in your launcher\n- Find `JVM Arguments (Head)`\n- Add `-Djava.net.useSystemProxies=true` argument\n- Done!\n\n## 🎉 此模组的第一个版本！\n\n### ✅ 已支持：\n- Gemini AI 生成！\n- 适配 Minecraft 组件！\n- 自定义和原版化！\n\n### 🎁 即将推出：\n- 支持 Ollama！（代码已写）\n- 风、火、水和土！\n\n### 🚗 试用：\n- 使用 Fabric 加载器和 Fabric API 创建一个 Minecraft 1.21.10 实例\n- 下载 `infinite-craft-1.0.0.jar` 并将其放入 `mods/` 文件夹\n- 在[此处](https://aistudio.google.com/app/api-keys)创建 API 密钥并将其放入 `config/InfiniteCraft.json` 中（如果不存在，请创建）：\n```json\n{\n  \"GeminiApiKey\": \"PUT_YOUR_KEY_HERE\"\n}\n```\n- 启动游戏！\n\n> Gemini 目前免费使用！\n\n### ⏏ 使用代理：\n- 确保您已启用系统代理\n- 在启动器中打开 Minecraft 设置\n- 找到“JVM 参数（头）”\n- 添加“-Djava.net.useSystemProxies=true”参数\n- 完成！"
